## BKT (Bayesian Knowledge Tracing)

- Skill-level tracking, question-level değil
- prior, learn, slip, guess parametreleri
- `slip + guess < 1` kısıtı (aksi halde impossible)

## Turkish NLP Tokenizer

- Qwen3-8B tokenizer KIRO2-özel (extended vocab: `qwen_extended_vocab/`)
- Türkçe agglutinative morfoloji — BPE tek başına yetersiz
- Yeni token eklerken: `.claude/skills/turkish-nlp/SKILL.md` referans

## Windows Path Replace (Session 48)

`str(Path(...))` Windows'ta backslash. Prompt replace sessizce fail olur:

```python
# YANLIŞ
prompt = prompt.replace(str(screenshot), str(enhanced))

# DOĞRU
old_fwd = str(screenshot).replace("\\", "/")
new_fwd = str(enhanced).replace("\\", "/")
prompt = prompt.replace(str(screenshot), str(enhanced))
prompt = prompt.replace(old_fwd, new_fwd)
```

